      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חַלָּמִישׁ</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino: sílex</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">חַלָּמִישׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 8:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.8.15\">Dt 8:15</a> + 3 vezes; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">חַלְמִישׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:13\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.13\">Dt 32:13</a>;—<em>sílex</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">צוּר הַח׳</span> <em>rocha de sílex</em> = rocha de sílex, de onde fluiu água para Israel no deserto <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 8:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.8.15\">Dt 8:15</a>, e (sem <span dir=\"rtl\">צור</span>) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 114:8\" href=\"/Psalms.114.8\">ψ 114:8</a>; trabalhado por mineiros <a data-ref=\"Job 28:9\" href=\"/Job.28.9\">Jb 28:9</a>; hiperbólico, <em>azeite de</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ צוּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:13\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.13\">Dt 32:13</a> <em>sílex de rocha</em> = sílex rochoso (poético);—em símile de firmeza <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל־כֵּן שַׂמְתִּי פָּנַי כַּחַלָּמִישׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 50:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.50.7\">Is 50:7</a>.",
