      "html": "† I. <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">חָלַץ</span></big></big>  <strong>verbo: tirar, arrancar, retirar-se (</strong>hebraico pós-bíblico <em>idem;</em> aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲלַץ</span>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܠܰܨ</span> <em>despojar</em>, geralmente Pa. etc.; fenício nome próprio <span dir=\"rtl\">חלצבעל</span> <em>Baal livrou</em>, e <span dir=\"rtl\">חלץ</span> isolado; árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">خَلَصَ</span> <em>retirar-se, recuar</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  perfeito <a data-ref=\"Hosea 5:6\" href=\"/Hosea.5.6\">Ho 5:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְחָֽלְצָה</span> consecutivo <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 25:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.25.9\">Dt 25:9</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חָֽלְצוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:3\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.3\">La 4:3</a>; imperfeito 2.ª masc. sing. <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּחֲלֹץ</span>; particípio passivo construto <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲלוּץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 25:10\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.25.10\">Dt 25:10</a>— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>tirar, retirar</em>, com acusativo de sandália <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 25:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.25.9\">Dt 25:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 20:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.20.2\">Is 20:2</a> (ambos seguidos de <span dir=\"rtl\">רֶגֶל</span> com <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span>), cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית חֲלוּץ הַנָּ֑עַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 25:10\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.25.10\">Dt 25:10</a>; <em>tirar para fora, apresentar</em> o peito, de animal que amamenta <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:3\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.3\">La 4:3</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  intransitivo, <em>retirar-se</em>, seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 5:6\" href=\"/Hosea.5.6\">Ho 5:6</a>.<br><strong>Niph.</strong>  perfeito <em>ser livrado</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶחֱלָ֑ץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.8\">Pr 11:8</a> (seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span>); imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יֵחָלֵ֑צוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.9\">Pr 11:9</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יֵחָֽלְצוּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 60:7\" href=\"/Psalms.60.7\">ψ 60:7</a> = <a data-ref=\"Psalms 108:7\" href=\"/Psalms.108.7\">108:7</a> (Ges<sup>§ 51. 2. R. 2</sup>).<br><strong>Pi.</strong>  perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">חִלֵּץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:43\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.43\">Lv 14:43</a> etc.; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יְחַלֵּץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 36:15\" href=\"/Job.36.15\">Jb 36:15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וָאֲחַלְּצָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 7:5\" href=\"/Psalms.7.5\">ψ 7:5</a> (mas quanto ao texto, ver abaixo, ao final); com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחַלֶּצְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 50:15\" href=\"/Psalms.50.15\">ψ 50:15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחַלְּצֶ֫ךָּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 81:8\" href=\"/Psalms.81.8\">ψ 81:8</a>, etc.; imperativo <span dir=\"rtl\">חַלְּצָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 6:5\" href=\"/Psalms.6.5\">ψ 6:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חַלְּצֵנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:153\" href=\"/Psalms.119.153\">ψ 119:153</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 140:2\" href=\"/Psalms.140.2\">140:2</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>arrancar, retirar à força</em> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:40\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.40\">Lv 14:40</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:43\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.43\">43</a> (P; pedras de casa infestada). <strong>2.</strong>  <em>resgatar, livrar</em>, com objeto de pessoa, mas somente poético;—seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">נפשׁי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 6:5\" href=\"/Psalms.6.5\">ψ 6:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 116:8\" href=\"/Psalms.116.8\">116:8</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(מִמָּ֫וֶת)</span>; cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 140:2\" href=\"/Psalms.140.2\">140:2</a> (seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span>); absoluto com acusativo <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:20\" href=\"/Psalms.18.20\">ψ 18:20</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:20\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.20\">2 S 22:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 34:8\" href=\"/Psalms.34.8\">ψ 34:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 50:15\" href=\"/Psalms.50.15\">50:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 81:8\" href=\"/Psalms.81.8\">81:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 91:15\" href=\"/Psalms.91.15\">91:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:153\" href=\"/Psalms.119.153\">119:153</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 36:15\" href=\"/Job.36.15\">Jb 36:15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וָאֲחַלְּצָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 7:5\" href=\"/Psalms.7.5\">ψ 7:5</a>; seguido de acusativo, <em>mas eu livrei</em> AV Hup Ri, cf. Ew; <em>e saqueei, despojei</em> Ges Hi De Bae (mas isto somente em aramaico); menos preferível que <em>e oprimi</em> (ler <span dir=\"rtl\">וָאֶֽלְחְצָה</span>) Krochm Dy Gr Che; (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּמַלְתִּי רַע</span>).",
