      "preview": "חָלַץ²: equipar para a guerra; fortalecer.",
      "html": "† II. <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">חָלַץ</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo: equipar para a guerra (</strong>ideia primária de <em>força, vigor</em>, ver Hiph., substantivo <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲלָצַיִם</span>, e assírio <em>ḫalṣu</em>, <em>fortificação</em> (Schr<sup>COT Gloss</sup> Asrb. <sup>Annals ii. 52</sup>), cf. <em>ḫhilṣu</em>, <em>cinto</em>, Zehnpfund<sup>BAS i. 499</sup>; aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܠܻܝܨ</span> <em>accinctus ad opus, strenuus</em> (cingido para o trabalho, enérgico), <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܠܻܝܨܽܘܬܳܐ</span> <em>fortitudo, strenuitas</em> (força, energia), grego ἀνδρεία, preferível a Thes Rob Ges SS, que consideram = I. <span dir=\"rtl\">חלץ</span> no sentido de <em>despir-se</em> para a batalha, <em>expeditus</em> (desimpedido)<strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  somente particípio passivo <span dir=\"rtl\">חָלוּץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:21\" href=\"/Numbers.32.21\">Nu 32:21</a> + 7 vezes, construto <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲלוּץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:27\" href=\"/Numbers.32.27\">Nu 32:27</a>; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲלוּצִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:30\" href=\"/Numbers.32.30\">Nu 32:30</a> + 2 vezes, construto <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲלוּצֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.24\">1 Ch 12:24</a> + 3 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲלֻצֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.4\">Is 15:4</a>;—<em>equipado:</em> <strong>1.</strong>  como adjetivo <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:30\" href=\"/Numbers.32.30\">Nu 32:30</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:32\" href=\"/Numbers.32.32\">32</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:18\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.18\">Dt 3:18</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  como substantivo singular coletivo <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:21\" href=\"/Numbers.32.21\">Nu 32:21</a> (JE; ver Niph., versículo <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:20\" href=\"/Numbers.32.20\">20</a>) <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:21\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.21\">2 Ch 20:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 28:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.28.14\">28:14</a>, com artigo <span dir=\"rtl\">הֶח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:7\" href=\"/Joshua.6.7\">Jos 6:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:9\" href=\"/Joshua.6.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:13\" href=\"/Joshua.6.13\">13</a> (JE); <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲלוּץ צָבָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:27\" href=\"/Numbers.32.27\">Nu 32:27</a> <em>homens equipados para a guerra</em> (JE), assim <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ הַמִּלְחָמָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:29\" href=\"/Numbers.32.29\">32:29</a> (P); <span dir=\"rtl\">הֶחָ׳ לַצָּבָא</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.24\">1 Ch 12:24</a> (versículo <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.23\">23</a> van d. H.); plural <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲלוּצֵי צָבָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:5\" href=\"/Numbers.31.5\">Nu 31:5</a> (P) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:25\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.25\">1 Ch 12:25</a> (versículo <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.24\">24</a> Van d. H.) <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 17:18\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.17.18\">2 Ch 17:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ הַצּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 4:13\" href=\"/Joshua.4.13\">Jos 4:13</a> (P); note-se <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲלֻצֵי מוֹאָב</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.4\">Is 15:4</a> <em>guerreiros</em> (<em>os equipados</em>, Che <em>homens de armas</em>) <em>de Moabe</em>.<br><strong>Niph.</strong>  imperfeito 2.ª masc. pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תֵּחָֽלְצוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:20\" href=\"/Numbers.32.20\">Nu 32:20</a>, 1.ª pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נֵחָלֵץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:17\" href=\"/Numbers.32.17\">Nu 32:17</a>; imperativo <span dir=\"rtl\">הֵחָֽלְצוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:3\" href=\"/Numbers.31.3\">Nu 31:3</a>; <em>estar</em> ou <em>ir equipado</em>, seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">לִפְנֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:17\" href=\"/Numbers.32.17\">Nu 32:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:20\" href=\"/Numbers.32.20\">20</a> (ambos JE; ver Qal particípio, versículo <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:21\" href=\"/Numbers.32.21\">21</a>); seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">לַצָּבָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:3\" href=\"/Numbers.31.3\">31:3</a> (P; imperativo Niph. aqui surpreendente com <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵאִתְּכֶם</span>, ver Di).<br><strong>Hiph.</strong>  imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">עַצְמֹתֶיךָ יַחֲלִיץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 58:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.58.11\">Is 58:11</a> <em>ele</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">(י׳)</span> <em>fortalecerá, revigorará teus ossos</em> (MV De Di; Hup Che nota crítica Du e outros leem <span dir=\"rtl\">יַחֲלִיף</span> <em>renovar, rejuvenescer</em>).",
