      "html": "† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֶלְקָה</span></big>  <strong>substantivo feminino: porção</strong> de terreno;—absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 4:7\" href=\"/Amos.4.7\">Am 4:7</a><sup>(×2)</sup> + 8 vezes; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶלְקַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 33:19\" href=\"/Genesis.33.19\">Gn 33:19</a> + 12 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶלְקָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 12:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.12.10\">Je 12:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶלְקָתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 24:18\" href=\"/Job.24.18\">Jb 24:18</a>; <em>porção</em> de terreno,<br><strong>1.</strong>  especialmente <strong>a.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ הַשָּׂדֶה</span> = o <em>campo</em> claramente delimitado <a data-ref=\"Genesis 33:19\" href=\"/Genesis.33.19\">Gn 33:19</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 24:32\" href=\"/Joshua.24.32\">Jos 24:32</a> (ambos E), <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:11\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.11\">2 S 23:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ruth 2:3\" href=\"/Ruth.2.3\">Ru 2:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ruth 4:3\" href=\"/Ruth.4.3\">4:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:25\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.25\">2 K 9:25</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:13\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.13\">1 Ch 11:13</a>. Também <strong>b.</strong>  sem <span dir=\"rtl\">השׂדה</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 4:7\" href=\"/Amos.4.7\">Am 4:7</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 14:30\" href=\"/II_Samuel.14.30\">2 S 14:30</a>;<sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 14:31\" href=\"/II_Samuel.14.31\">31</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:12\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.12\">23:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 3:19\" href=\"/II_Kings.3.19\">2 K 3:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 3:25\" href=\"/II_Kings.3.25\">25</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:21\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.21\">9:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:26\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.26\">26</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:14\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.14\">1 Ch 11:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 24:18\" href=\"/Job.24.18\">Jb 24:18</a>; da terra de <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 12:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.12.10\">Je 12:10</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּרְמִי</span>); cf. também nome próprio de lugar <span dir=\"rtl\">חלקת הַצֻּרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 2:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.2.16\">2 S 2:16</a> <em>campo dos gumes de espadas</em> (Dr). 𝔊 Ew<sup>G iii. 156, Eng. tr. 114</sup> We leem <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ הַצֹּדִים</span> <em>campo dos conspiradores</em> ou <em>dos que estão de emboscada</em> (ver Dr).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>porção</em> de terreno atribuída a alguém, <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ מחקק</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:21\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.21\">Dt 33:21</a> <em>porção do comandante</em>.",
