      "html": "† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמוּדָה</span>]</big>  <strong>substantivo feminino: caráter desejável, preciosidade</strong>—plural absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמוּדוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:23\" href=\"/Daniel.9.23\">Dn 9:23</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמוּדֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:27\" href=\"/Ezra.8.27\">Ezr 8:37</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמֻדוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:25\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.25\">2 Ch 20:25</a> + 4 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמֻדֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:15\" href=\"/Genesis.27.15\">Gn 27:15</a>; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמֻדוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:43\" href=\"/Daniel.11.43\">Dn 11:43</a>;—<em>coisas desejáveis, seletas</em>, isto é, vestes <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:15\" href=\"/Genesis.27.15\">Gn 27:15</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בגדים</span>); cf. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:38\" href=\"/Daniel.11.38\">Dn 11:38</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אבן יקרה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:43\" href=\"/Daniel.11.43\">11:43</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(חֲמֻדוֹת מִצְרַיִם)</span>; = <em>coisas preciosas</em> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:27\" href=\"/Ezra.8.27\">Ezr 8:27</a> (como ouro); <span dir=\"rtl\">כלי ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:25\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.25\">2 Ch 20:25</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לֶחֶם ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 10:3\" href=\"/Daniel.10.3\">Dn 10:3</a>; de homem somente <span dir=\"rtl\">אִיֹשׁ־ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 10:11\" href=\"/Daniel.10.11\">Dn 10:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 10:19\" href=\"/Daniel.10.19\">19</a>, e, sem <span dir=\"rtl\">אישׁ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ אָ֑תָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:23\" href=\"/Daniel.9.23\">Dn 9:23</a> <em>tu és um tesouro precioso</em> (quanto à construção, ver Dr<sup>§ 189, 2</sup>; ver Bev e cf. o negativo <span dir=\"rtl\">חמד</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 53:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.53.2\">Is 53:2</a>).",
