      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמוּטַל</span></big>  Qr, <span dir=\"rtl\">חמיטל</span> Kt, <strong>nome próprio feminino (</strong>significado duvidoso; talvez, se Kt estiver correto, <em>o pai de meu marido é o orvalho</em>, cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֲבִיטָ֑ל\" href=\"/BDB,_אֲבִיטָ֑ל\", dir=\"rtl\">אֲבִיטַל</a><strong>)</strong>—𝔊 Αμειται, Μιτατ; A Αμιταλ, Αμιταθ; 𝔊L Αμιταλ;—mãe dos reis Jeoacaz e Zedequias, filhos de Josias <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:31\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.31\">2 K 23:31</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 24:18\" href=\"/II_Kings.24.18\">24:18</a> Qr (Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">חמיטל</span>) = <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 52:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.52.1\">Je 52:1</a> Qr (Kt <em>idem</em>)",
