      "html": "<big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֵמָה</span></big>  <em>ira</em>, ver sob <a data-ref=\"BDB, יָחַם\" href=\"/BDB,_יָחַם\", dir=\"rtl\">יחם</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵמָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 29:6\" href=\"/Job.29.6\">Jb 29:6</a>, ver <a data-ref=\"BDB, חֶמְאָה\" href=\"/BDB,_חֶמְאָה\", dir=\"rtl\">חֶמְאָה</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חַמָּה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חַמָּן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חַמּוֹן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חַמַּת</span> ver sob <a data-ref=\"BDB, חָמַם\" href=\"/BDB,_חָמַם\", dir=\"rtl\">חמם</a>.",
