      "preview": "חָמַל: poupar, ter compaixão.",
      "html": "† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">חָמַל</span></big></big>  <strong>verbo: poupar (</strong>árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">حَمَلَ</span> significa <em>carregar, tornar-se responsável;</em> aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܡܰܠ</span> <em>comportavit, congessit</em> (transportou, ajuntou)<strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:15\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.15\">1 S 15:15</a> + 3 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">חָמָ֑ל</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 12:6\" href=\"/II_Samuel.12.6\">2 S 12:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:17\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.17\">La 2:17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חָמָ֑לְתָּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:21\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.21\">La 2:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:43\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.43\">3:43</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְחָמַלְתִּ֫י</span> <a data-ref=\"Malachi 3:17\" href=\"/Malachi.3.17\">Mal 3:17</a>; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יַחְמֹל</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 16:13\" href=\"/Job.16.13\">Jb 16:13</a> + 6 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">יַחְמוֹל</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 6:10\" href=\"/Job.6.10\">Jb 6:10</a> + 3 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיַּחְמֹל</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:9\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.9\">1 S 15:9</a> + 3 vezes; 3.ª fem. sing. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתַּחְמֹל</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 2:6\" href=\"/Exodus.2.6\">Ex 2:6</a>; 2.ª masc. sing. <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּחְמֹל</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 13:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.13.9\">Dt 13:9</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.3\">1 S 15:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶחְמֹל</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 8:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.8.18\">Ez 8:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 9:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.9.10\">9:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶחְמוֹל</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.14\">Je 13:14</a> + 4 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">וָאֶחְמֹל</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 36:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.36.21\">Ez 36:21</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יַחְמֹ֑לוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.18\">Is 9:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּחְמְלוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.14\">Je 50:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.3\">51:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּחְמֹ֑לוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 9:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.9.5\">Ez 9:5</a>; infinitivo construto <span dir=\"rtl\">חֻמְלָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.5\">Ez 16:5</a> (Ges<sup>§ 45. 1. b</sup>);—<em>poupar, ter compaixão</em>, com <span dir=\"rtl\">על</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 2:6\" href=\"/Exodus.2.6\">Ex 2:6</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.3\">1 S 15:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:9\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:15\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.15\">15</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 23:21\" href=\"/I_Samuel.23.21\">23:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:7\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.7\">2 S 21:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 36:15\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.36.15\">2 Ch 36:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 36:17\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.36.17\">17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 15:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.15.5\">Je 15:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.5\">Ez 16:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 36:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.36.21\">36:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 20:13\" href=\"/Job.20.13\">Jb 20:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 11:5\" href=\"/Zechariah.11.5\">Zc 11:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 11:6\" href=\"/Zechariah.11.6\">6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Malachi 3:17\" href=\"/Malachi.3.17\">Mal 3:17</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:18\" href=\"/Joel.2.18\">Jo 2:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 13:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.13.9\">Dt 13:9</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חוס</span> seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">על</span>), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 21:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.21.7\">Je 21:7</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חוס</span> seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">על</span> + <span dir=\"rtl\">רתם</span>), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 9:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.9.10\">Ez 9:10</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חוס</span> seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">על</span> segundo 𝔖 𝔗 Co); seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל־</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.3\">Je 51:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.18\">Is 9:18</a>; note-se o poético <span dir=\"rtl\">אַל־תַּחְ׳ אֶל־חֵץ</span> = <em>não poupar flecha alguma</em> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.14\">Je 50:14</a>; seguido de infinitivo <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 12:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.12.4\">2 S 12:4</a>; absoluto <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 12:6\" href=\"/II_Samuel.12.6\">2 S 12:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.14\">Is 30:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:17\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.17\">La 2:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:21\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.21\">21</a>, também versículo <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:2\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.2\">2</a>, onde aparentemente seguido de acusativo, <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:43\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.43\">3:43</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 6:10\" href=\"/Job.6.10\">Jb 6:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 16:13\" href=\"/Job.16.13\">16:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 27:22\" href=\"/Job.27.22\">27:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:34\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.34\">Pr 6:34</a>; <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:17\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.17\">Hb 1:17</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חוס</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 5:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.5.11\">Ez 5:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 7:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.7.4\">7:4</a> (suprimido por Co como duplicata do versículo <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 7:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.7.9\">9</a>), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 7:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.7.9\">7:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 8:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.8.18\">8:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 9:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.9.5\">9:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.14\">Jer 13:14</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אחוס</span> e <span dir=\"rtl\">ארחם</span>).",
