      "html": "† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">חָמַם</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo:</strong> estar ou tornar-se quente <strong>(</strong>hebraico pós-bíblico <em>idem</em>, Pi., <em>aquecer</em>, aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܰܡ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲמַם</span> <em>estar quente;</em> árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">حَمَّ</span> <em>tornar-se quente</em>, de água; também <em>aquecer, atear fogo em</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">חַם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 39:4\" href=\"/Psalms.39.4\">ψ 39:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:21\" href=\"/Exodus.16.21\">Ex 16:21</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְחַם</span> consecutivo <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:2\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.2\">1 K 1:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 4:11\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.4.11\">Ec 4:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חַמּוֹתִ֫י</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.16\">Is 44:16</a>; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יָחֹם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.16\">Is 44:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּ֫חָם</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:34\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.34\">2 K 4:34</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.15\">Is 44:15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יִחַם</span> (<span dir=\"rtl\">יֵ</span> K<sup>3</sup>) <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:1\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.1\">1 K 1:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יֵחַם</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 19:6\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.19.6\">Dt 19:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יֵחָ֑ם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 4:11\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.4.11\">Ec 4:11</a>; 3.ª fem. sing. <span dir=\"rtl\">תֵּחַם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.11\">Ez 24:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יֵחַמּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 7:7\" href=\"/Hosea.7.7\">Ho 7:7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיֶּחֱמוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:29\" href=\"/Genesis.30.29\">Gn 30:39</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיֵּחַמְנָה</span> versículo <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:38\" href=\"/Genesis.30.38\">38</a> (as últimas sete formas poderiam também ser de <span dir=\"rtl\">יחם</span>, ver este; mas não há evidência decisiva de que esta raiz seja empregada no Qal; são colocadas sob <span dir=\"rtl\">חמם</span> por Thes Ew<sup>§ 193 a</sup> Ol<sup>§ 243 b</sup>; ver também Kö<sup>i. 365, 417 ff.</sup>, que, por causa de <span dir=\"rtl\">יחם</span> Pi. infinitivo <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:41\" href=\"/Genesis.30.41\">Gn 30:41</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:10\" href=\"/Genesis.31.10\">31:10</a>, deriva as duas últimas, desnecessariamente, de <span dir=\"rtl\">יחם</span>); infinitivo <span dir=\"rtl\">לַחְמָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 47:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.47.14\">Is 47:14</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Job 30:4\" href=\"/Job.30.4\">Jb 30:4</a> (onde, porém, <span dir=\"rtl\">ל׳</span> é de <span dir=\"rtl\">לֶחֶם</span> Mich Di, a menos que [Luzz Che] leiamos <span dir=\"rtl\">לְחַמֵּם</span> Pi. infinitivo em ambos); <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹם</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 11:9\" href=\"/I_Samuel.11.9\">1 S 11:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Haggai 1:6\" href=\"/Haggai.1.6\">Hg 1:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:3\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.3\">Ne 7:3</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">חֻמּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 6:17\" href=\"/Job.6.17\">Jb 6:17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֻמָּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:39\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.39\">Je 51:39</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  literalmente, <em>estar</em> ou <em>tornar-se quente</em> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:21\" href=\"/Exodus.16.21\">Ex 16:21</a> (P; sujeito <span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁמֶשׁ</span>), cf. <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 11:9\" href=\"/I_Samuel.11.9\">1 S 11:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:3\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.3\">Ne 7:3</a> e <a data-ref=\"Job 6:17\" href=\"/Job.6.17\">Jb 6:17</a> (sufixo de sujeito impessoal); pelo fogo <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.15\">Is 44:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.16\">16</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 47:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.47.14\">47:14</a> (cf. acima); calor natural <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:1\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.1\">1 K 1:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:2\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.2\">2</a> (por contato pessoal), assim <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:34\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.34\">2 K 4:34</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 4:11\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.4.11\">Ec 4:11</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, por vestuário <a data-ref=\"Haggai 1:6\" href=\"/Haggai.1.6\">Hg 1:6</a>; de Jerusalém sob a figura de panela ou caldeirão <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.11\">Ez 24:11</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  figuradamente, sujeito <span dir=\"rtl\">לִבִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 39:4\" href=\"/Psalms.39.4\">ψ 39:4</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּהֲגִיגִי תִבְעַר־אֵשׁ</span>), cf. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 19:6\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.19.6\">Dt 19:6</a>; de conspiradores <a data-ref=\"Hosea 7:7\" href=\"/Hosea.7.7\">Ho 7:7</a>; caldeus <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:39\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.39\">Je 51:39</a>. <strong>3.</strong>  de calor na concepção (animais) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:38\" href=\"/Genesis.30.38\">Gn 30:38</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:39\" href=\"/Genesis.30.39\">39</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, יָחַם\" href=\"/BDB,_יָחַם\", dir=\"rtl\">יחם</a>).<br><strong>Niph.</strong>  particípio <span dir=\"rtl\">נֵחָמִים באלים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 57:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.57.5\">Is 57:5</a> (Kö<sup>i.371</sup>), <em>inflamar-se com</em>, de idolatria.<br><strong>Pi.</strong>  imperfeito 3.ª fem. sing. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּחַמֵּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 39:14\" href=\"/Job.39.14\">Jb 39:14</a> <em>manter</em> os ovos <em>quentes</em> (do avestruz).<br><strong>Hithp.</strong>  imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יִתְחַמָּם</span> <em>aquecer-se</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 31:20\" href=\"/Job.31.20\">Jb 31:20</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">מִגֵּז כְּבָשִׂים</span> <em>por meio de lã de ovelhas</em>.",
