      "html": "† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">חַמָּן</span>]</big>  <strong>substantivo masculino: pilar solar</strong>, empregado no culto idolátrico <strong>(</strong>ver Thes<sup>489 ff.</sup> RS<sup>Sem, i, 485</sup> Lag <sup>Mi, 228</sup> Now<sup>Arch. ii, 302</sup>; = palmireno <span dir=\"rtl\">חמנא</span> Vog<sup>No. 123 a</sup>; = Cooke <sup>N. Sem. Inscr., No. 136</sup>; Lzb<sup>Ephem. ii. (1906), 280</sup>; fenício <span dir=\"rtl\">לבעל חמן</span>, frequentemente como epíteto do Baal solar<strong>)</strong>;—somente plural absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">חַמָּנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 27:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.27.9\">Is 27:9</a> + 4 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">חַמָּנֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:30\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.30\">Lv 26:30</a> + 2 vezes; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּמוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:30\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.30\">Lv 26:30</a> (H), <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 14:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.14.4\">2 Ch 14:4</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 6:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.6.4\">Ez 6:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 6:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.6.6\">6</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מזבחות הבעלים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.4\">2 Ch 34:4</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אשׁרים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 17:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.17.8\">Is 17:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 27:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.27.9\">27:9</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אשׁרים</span> e <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּסִלִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:7\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.7\">2 Ch 34:7</a>.",
